1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,940
English endings matter too.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:10,677
The ed of walked is a t sound; of played, a d; and of wanted, a whole extra syllable, id.

3
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:19,544
It is id only after t or d; t after voiceless sounds like k, p and s; and d after the rest.

